ojant pro Trakų pilį...</b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash3/q77/s720x720/554517_504571206301928_27423806_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><b></b></a></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20180626040951im_/https://fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-frc1/q77/s720x720/554517_504571216301927_858962326_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Visus 18 km procesija ėjo su malda (nuotraukoje - giedotojos)</b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20180626040951im_/https://fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-frc3/q75/s720x720/1234865_504571822968533_1880841106_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Primoji trumpa stotelė<br><br><a href=\"https://fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash3/1174593_10201781036227067_1622966841_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20180626040951im_/https://fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash3/1174593_10201781036227067_1622966841_n.jpg\" width=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"179\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20180626040951im_/https://fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash3/536810_1408134142743180_1020402626_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b><br></b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20180626040951im_/https://fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-prn2/q77/s720x720/1239503_504576626301386_1078765016_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Procesija pasiekia Vievį</b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20180626040951im_/https://fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash3/q77/s720x720/1236238_504577432967972_1886057812_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Vievio Dievo Motinos užmigimo (Ėmimo į Dangų) cerkvė</b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20180626040951im_/https://fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash3/q71/s720x720/1176240_504574179634964_2050196514_n.jpg\" width=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Cerkvės interjeras</b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20180626040951im_/https://fbcdn-sphotos-c-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-ash3/q73/s720x720/1236238_504577442967971_2024239126_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Cerkvės klebonas - abatas (hegumenas) Benjaminas</b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20180626040951im_/https://fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net/hphotos-ak-prn2/q79/s720x720/1240632_504573496301699_1089010178_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></b></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Lauko virtuvė</b></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.ak